sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI
  participant Validate as ValidateForTarget
  participant Plan as RenderPlanBuilder
  participant Renderer
  participant Exporter
  User->>UI: Choose document, profile and export target
  UI->>Validate: Validate context
  Validate-->>UI: Errors/warnings/info
  UI->>Plan: Build deterministic render plan
  Plan->>Renderer: Render target representation
  Renderer->>Exporter: HTML/Canvas/PDF model
  Exporter-->>User: Print, Blob, file or handoff
